 benefits to growing up as the  brother of Mellie Otis including the  fact that zelgius had the opportunity to  train with his brother and due to his  brother's immense power this meant that  zelgius had the opportunity to keep  getting stronger another very important  aspect of zelda says difficult family  situation is of course his father the  demon king we don't know who the mother  of Medicine's ljust was or what she was  like but we know that the demon king is  a ruthless ruler with serious trust  issues because he was betrayed multiple  times including by the original demon  and then later by Mellie Otis the demon  king doesn't trust anyone and he values  power and control above all else the  reason he values power and control is  because being completely in control  reduces the chances of someone betraying  you or stabbing you in the back  and because he is so obsessed with  control the demon king considers the  things that cannot be controlled such as  love and compassion to be signs of  weakness growing up with a father who  rejects all forms of emotion including  love and compassion and values only  ruthless power and control would be  difficult for anyone and zelgius is no  exception by the way if you would like  to know more about the psychology of the  demon king and why he became the type of  person he is today feel free to check  out my video on the demon king and his  psyche link in the description now just  try to put yourself in zelgius shoes he  grew up in the shadow of his older and  stronger brother and he grew up with a  father who valued power above all else  so naturally the father would prefer to  stronger brother and treat the younger  and weaker brother less favorably the  demon king makes it a point to mock the  idea of love and falling for a woman and  he calls anyone who falls in love weak  so it is likely that zelgius would have  internalized some of this contempt for  love when Mele Otis betrays the demon  clan because he fell in love with  Elisabeth zelgius is furious and he  wants revenge having been raised to  think that love is weakness zelgius  blames Elisabeth for corrupting his  brother and he initially shares his  father's disgust for what meliodas has  done at first glance it might appear  that zelda's grew up to become exactly  what his father wanted him to be a  ruthless demon prince who values only  power and loyalty and who scoffs at the  idea of love and emotion but there is  more to sell just a story we later  learned that despite of all the love  bashing that the demon king must have  exposed him to growing up zelgius did  eventually end up falling in love with a  woman named zelda who was a member of  the vampire clan during the previous  holy war the vampires were allied with  the demons but at some point the vampire  King is raff decided to rebel against  the demon king and for this betrayal the  demon king sentenced the entire vampire  clan to death what's more the demon king  sent zelgius to carry out the death  sentence precisely because he wanted to  remind eldress that he must be loyal to  the demon king above all else and that  he must never let a woman or feelings of  any kind get in the way however despite  all the indoctrination that he had been  exposed to for his entire life by the  demon king zell drous cannot bring  himself to kill gelda so he decides to  seal the vampires away instead of  killing them by doing this  zel just betrays his father and his  wishes and it isn't hard to see that  zelgius is apparent hatred for meliodas  and Elizabeth and their betrayal is in  part a manifestation of the self-hatred  that zelgius feels because he knows that  he also betrayed his father in the name  of love just like Mellie Otis  it might seem hypocritical for zelgius  to be angry at meliodas when he is also  guilty of a similar sin but it isn't  uncommon for someone who feels guilt  about their own actions to project that  guilt onto others and to be angry at  them because this is usually much easier  than actually coming to terms with your  own inner demons no pun intended  nonetheless zelgius does eventually come  to terms with his true feelings and he  decides that his love for gelda is more  important than his loyalty to a ruthless  and merciless father even though we find  out that he had hopes of becoming the  next demon king himself so that he could  free gelda and bring peace and harmony  to the underworld soldiers decides to  support his older brother Mellie Otis in  becoming the next demon king in return  for meliodas releasing gelda from the  seal so that they could finally be  together the demon king later mocks  zelgius his ambition to become the next  demon king and bring peace and harmony  to the clans of the underworld including  the demons and vampires but this  ambition that zelgius held tells us a  lot about what kind of person he  actually is even though he was raised by  the ruthless demon king Zell just wanted  to be a different kind of ruler someone  who governs through peace and harmony  rather than war and terror even though  he eventually gave up on his ambition to  become the demon king and decided to  support meliodas if he had become the  demon king it is clear that zelgius  would have ruled much differently from  his father he would not have considered  his love for gelda to be a weakness and  he would have tried to reconcile the  different factions of the underworld  instead of simply destroying all  perceived threats and rivals after  meliodas agrees to release gelda if he  becomes the demon king zelgius willingly  sacrifices himself multiple times in  order to make that happen he challenges  Eskin or Merle and Ludo shell Maya and  the others when they attempt to stop  meliodas from absorbing the commandments  and as we know as eldress takes a  significant amount of punishment as a  result and when it turns out that  malleolus had not become the demon king  but instead the demon king had possessed  h